00:58:41.050 --> 00:58:47.620
<v Will Seymour>When I hear this song, I think of you. It's the theme of the TV show Love, Sydney with Tony Randall.
<v Will Seymour>当我听到这首歌时，我会想到你。它是电视节目《爱，悉尼》的主题曲，托尼·兰德尔主演的那部。

